Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.76,0:00:05.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew you would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.67,0:00:08.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you know how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.72,0:00:12.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know some things have happened\Nbetween you guys and me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.68,0:00:15.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but you and I are\Nessentially very similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.27,0:00:21.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that's the reason why Edward-kun doesn't want to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.27,0:00:25.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother doesn't want to use the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.82,0:00:28.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:31.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You brothers were, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.03,0:00:35.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We journeyed together to\Nget back that which we had lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:37.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's everything that we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.51,0:00:54.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you in pain, Nina?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.27,0:00:59.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right.\NAll preparations\Nare in order now...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.11,0:01:10.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your body, as well as the lives which were provided by many animals...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.95,0:01:13.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All that's left now is to join them all together
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.24,0:01:15.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,with the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.41,0:01:21.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did you know about me\Nhaving the Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.88,0:01:23.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Simple reasoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.75,0:01:27.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Judging by the injuries to Archer, I could tell what had happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.22,0:01:31.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the center of it was Scar, \Nthe scarred man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.26,0:01:35.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then I heard that\Nyou two had fled.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.31,0:01:40.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,King Bradley only wants one thing: the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.44,0:01:44.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You knew?\NAbout the Führer\Nbeing a homunculus?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.57,0:01:50.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey now, how many years do you think I spent in the 5th Laboratory, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.32,0:01:53.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They used to go there,\Nalong with that other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:55.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That other one?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.41,0:01:58.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The one who raised and\Nis leading the homunculi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.91,0:02:01.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a moment.\NBy any chance, is that person...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.42,0:02:02.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll talk later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.75,0:02:06.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have obtained something that\Nthey wanted so bad they can't stand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.46,0:02:12.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, bring it out!\NA real, genuine Philosopher's Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.26,0:02:15.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please do not touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.89,0:02:23.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I{\i0} am the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.15,0:02:26.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.07,0:02:30.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's the reason why\NEdward-kun didn't come, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:31.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.40,0:02:33.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't know\Nwhat will happen to my body
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.20,0:02:35.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if we use the Philosopher's Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.82,0:02:37.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,at least not until\Nwe carefully research it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.08,0:02:40.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He said he wanted to do something about the homunculi before then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.29,0:02:44.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know that Brother\Nis worried about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.29,0:02:47.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I want to return Brother to the way he used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.50,0:02:49.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you know of\Na way to do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.21,0:02:52.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course I do. I will teach you\Nhow to use the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.13,0:02:58.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, I want you to\Nlet me use its power as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:00.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An equivalent exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.73,0:03:08.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.77,0:03:13.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those who obtain it are set free from the Law of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.36,0:03:18.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is no need to pay a price\Nin order to obtain something, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.33,0:03:23.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We sought it and found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.10,0:05:12.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Most of it has been disposed of.\NThese books are all worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.19,0:05:15.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What kind of person was Dante-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.61,0:05:20.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was a great alchemist,\None who inherited this crest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.66,0:05:21.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or that's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.99,0:05:22.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What you thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.83,0:05:29.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was positively ingenious in her knowledge of alchemy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:29.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and hid it completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.71,0:05:31.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that go without saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.13,0:05:36.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, we encrypt our secrets\Nabout alchemy and record them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.38,0:05:38.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was incorrigible about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.88,0:05:42.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If alchemy was for the good of mankind, why hide it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.05,0:05:47.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She chose to live a life in the forest, where she wouldn't meet anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.31,0:05:49.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For what reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.52,0:05:57.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought you would be thrilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.11,0:06:02.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does this mean that you were just another ordinary person?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:04.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving the forest\Nto live in the city—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.45,0:06:07.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,among the people who need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.83,0:06:11.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you're going to live your life\Nfor the gratitude of others?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.42,0:06:16.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you just go ahead and enlist as a State Alchemist?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.17,0:06:19.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.59,0:06:21.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.51,0:06:22.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.88,0:06:25.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you like other people?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.05,0:06:28.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How could I like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.60,0:06:32.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're selfish creatures without any merit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.94,0:06:37.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They learn how to use a little gunpowder, and there is nothing but war.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.52,0:06:41.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If they were to learn all of the secrets of alchemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.19,0:06:42.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,how much calamity do you think would come about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.53,0:06:46.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so, I am human!\NAnd so are you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.92,0:06:57.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There was one name that you could never utter in her presence:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.17,0:07:01.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hohenheim of Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.72,0:07:05.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-My old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.14,0:07:07.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.35,0:07:09.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like she couldn't\Nbring herself to throw this away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.39,0:07:17.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a love letter from\NHohenheim to Dante.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.27,0:07:19.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,J-Just a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.57,0:07:22.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I met Dante-san, and she was pretty old.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.86,0:07:25.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She looked like she was twenty years older than my old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.86,0:07:27.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not what the issue is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.20,0:07:30.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This has the year written on it\Nin the Christian calendar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.79,0:07:31.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Christian calendar?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.33,0:07:36.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was based on an ancient religion that isn't practiced now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.79,0:07:38.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,According to this, the letter...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.38,0:07:41.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,was written four hundred years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.93,0:07:48.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.55,0:07:49.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.22,0:07:52.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe the names are just the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.85,0:07:56.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's possible that the one\Ncontrolling all the homunculi is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.23,0:07:58.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're jumping to conclusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.15,0:08:01.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But are you prepared for that,\Njust in case?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.74,0:08:11.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry I couldn't be of any help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.45,0:08:15.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay. This is something we'll do by ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.25,0:08:17.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:23.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.30,0:08:27.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You fool...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.80,0:08:31.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.57,0:08:46.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's about to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.24,0:08:48.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If war breaks out in the north,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.24,0:08:51.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it'll be different from the civil uprisings\Nwe've had up to now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.37,0:08:52.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm laid up\Nat a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.12,0:08:56.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.04,0:09:01.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Havoc, you won't get lonely.\NYou'll have another friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.46,0:09:07.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sergeant Fuery, \Nsome nasty athlete's foot
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.71,0:09:07.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,was discovered during your examination the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.38,0:09:09.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It has already spread to your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.43,0:09:12.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's how it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.43,0:09:14.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You won't be moving out either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.81,0:09:23.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.03,0:09:26.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Surely, you jest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.57,0:09:33.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clearly, the north is\Nengaging in military actions,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.08,0:09:37.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and we cannot help but say that it would be foolish
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.83,0:09:41.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to overlook this and take up the matter\Nof our already established borders again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.25,0:09:45.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, the Führer has\Ncome to a wise conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.25,0:09:49.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We will gather our forces in the Briggs Mountains, \Nalong the border to the north,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.88,0:09:53.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,where we will purge\Nany and all infiltrators!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.35,0:09:59.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You who are assembled here today \Nare the best of the best
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.10,0:09:59.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and will be the first ones there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.73,0:10:03.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for all of these\Ndifficult missions in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.56,0:10:05.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel it's an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.57,0:10:10.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I believe the suspicions\Nabout you are unfounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.15,0:10:11.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is my proof of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.78,0:10:15.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will live up to your expectations,\NYour Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.78,0:10:18.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish you good luck,\NBrigadier General Roy Mustang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.16,0:10:22.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Col.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:24.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alex Louis Armstrong, support him well for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.38,0:10:25.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.29,0:10:30.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, with our main forces\Nconcentrated in the north,\NI am concerned for\Nthe defense of Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.84,0:10:31.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.05,0:10:33.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Frank Archer is eager to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.22,0:10:35.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Archer?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.60,0:10:38.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean, that man is still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.18,0:11:17.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A job well done, Führer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.56,0:11:22.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are no legends of the\NPhilosopher's Stone in the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.60,0:11:23.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even by fanning the flames of war,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.85,0:11:27.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there isn't anyone there who will be\Ndriven to create a Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.31,0:11:31.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all right. Your purpose this time\Nis the leadership of the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.40,0:11:34.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyone who comes near the\NPhilosopher's Stone is destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.41,0:11:37.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those who are soldiers\Nare not excepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.37,0:11:40.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then it's not just Mustang.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.79,0:11:41.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.83,0:11:45.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone who was involved with\Nthe Hughes affair is going to die in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.96,0:11:46.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Courtesy of Envy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.21,0:11:49.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you mean me, I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.96,0:11:55.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I thought I told you\Nto wait up north.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.51,0:11:57.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard that {\i1}he{\i0} was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.26,0:11:58.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're being rude, Envy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.05,0:12:00.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Out of my way, you human poser!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.72,0:12:03.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't have you\Ntalk to him like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.23,0:12:08.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He is a homunculus that appears to age \Nlike a person and is one of my masterpieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.94,0:12:09.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.27,0:12:11.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"He" who?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.28,0:12:13.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.74,0:12:16.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The same way you made Pride and\NGreed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.57,0:12:19.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's toying with me—toying with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.37,0:12:22.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hohenheim of Light?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.45,0:12:25.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's here, right?! Where is he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.66,0:12:27.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You miss your birth father?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.04,0:12:32.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.63,0:12:33.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.63,0:12:34.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.05,0:12:37.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way he could die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.72,0:12:39.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who will\Nkill him, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.80,0:12:43.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I disrupted the union of\Nhis spirit, body, and mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.43,0:12:44.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.93,0:12:47.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not true! It's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.44,0:12:48.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.27,0:12:50.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He was supposed to be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.40,0:12:51.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mine! Mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.40,0:12:53.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(360,470)}Mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:54.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His sons are still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.49,0:12:56.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To hell with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.65,0:12:59.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even once you hear that they have obtained a Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.20,0:13:04.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They have a Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.29,0:13:05.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.45,0:13:09.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At this rate, those boys are going to take everything back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.08,0:13:10.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't let them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.25,0:13:16.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's unfair, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.92,0:13:16.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those boys getting to take everything back,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.34,0:13:19.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,while you, who should be\Nhis dearest son...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.39,0:13:21.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are unable to obtain anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.85,0:13:23.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to see them...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.39,0:13:27.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the expressions on their faces when the\NPhilosopher's Stone is taken from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.27,0:13:31.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Their expressions when they lose everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.94,0:13:39.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"I'm going to Tucker-san's place."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.49,0:13:43.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shou Tucker. I thought he ran away at Liore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.66,0:13:44.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.87,0:13:47.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do you think Tucker called him there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.08,0:13:49.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.71,0:13:52.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To complete that useless Chimera of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.92,0:13:54.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.34,0:13:57.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tucker learned a lot of things from the 5th Laboratory,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.01,0:13:59.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,including things about\Nthe Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.88,0:14:04.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And since he knows,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.88,0:14:05.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the Fullmetal brothers will know \Nhow to use the Philosopher's Stone too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.51,0:14:08.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking, Lust?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.44,0:14:12.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wrath,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.65,0:14:14.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,take care of everything\Nelse here for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.77,0:14:16.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're leaving?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.15,0:14:18.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.62,0:14:27.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My word, your brother is a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.62,0:14:33.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He struck upon this seven-sided transmutation circle right on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.50,0:14:34.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean, you just copied it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.84,0:14:38.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like you to say that\NI expanded on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.51,0:14:42.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But still, the fact is, Edward-kun came very close to the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.30,0:14:49.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He probably realized that this method could be used to activate the Philosopher's Stone as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.98,0:14:54.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother was concerned\Nabout my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.77,0:14:59.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He just thought you should be giving precedence to regenerating your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.94,0:15:04.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He doesn't seem to have any interest in using the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.99,0:15:05.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.20,0:15:07.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's probably because...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.33,0:15:13.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.00,0:15:15.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could you come\Nover here for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.93,0:15:30.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tucker-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.22,0:15:33.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to have you\Npay me in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.98,0:15:36.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.\NBringing Nina back to life
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.02,0:15:40.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,will be nothing at all for a \NPhilosopher's Stone as huge as this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.11,0:15:42.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.19,0:15:43.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm still...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.74,0:15:46.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nina, Nina, it will be soon now...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.95,0:15:47.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tucker-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.33,0:15:52.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.79,0:15:54.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.50,0:16:00.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.00,0:16:03.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're looking well, for someone being pursued by the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.22,0:16:07.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard about what you are\Nfrom my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.89,0:16:09.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:10.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.64,0:16:13.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't try anything funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.39,0:16:15.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.60,0:16:19.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you I knew\Nwhat you were!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.23,0:16:23.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wrath!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.94,0:16:26.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Today's the day\Nwhen I will have them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.07,0:16:28.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but they're not for sale!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.95,0:16:32.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.46,0:16:40.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wrath!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.84,0:16:42.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're going to beg for your life,\NI'm not listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.80,0:16:46.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's all right. If you want my arm or leg, take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.51,0:16:49.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got the greatest\NAutomail mechanic around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.64,0:16:52.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She'll give me something even cooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.51,0:16:53.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.72,0:16:55.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But answer me one thing—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.43,0:17:01.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if you take my arm and leg from me\Nand attach them to yourself,\Nwill that make you human?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:07.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if I have to use Automail—\Neven if my whole body becomes armor,\Nso what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.28,0:17:08.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm still human.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.40,0:17:10.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.28,0:17:11.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.70,0:17:16.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lust! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.67,0:17:19.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.62,0:17:22.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't kill him,\NI'm telling you-know-who on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.30,0:17:34.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get him, Lust!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.89,0:17:37.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want to become human too,\Ndon't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.23,0:17:40.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If there is a Philosopher's Stone, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.02,0:17:45.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your little brother went off to Tucker's place\Nand is learning how to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.44,0:17:51.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you find out how...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.41,0:17:54.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lust, what are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.62,0:17:55.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.70,0:17:57.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,make me human?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.12,0:18:00.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lust!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.46,0:18:03.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.79,0:18:04.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.88,0:18:10.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cut it out. Do you seriously think I would make you guys human?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.17,0:18:11.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.14,0:18:16.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you were to make us human, \Nyou wouldn't be chased after any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.06,0:18:18.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your enemies would be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.98,0:18:21.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.86,0:18:29.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What were we told?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.19,0:18:31.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You heard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.82,0:18:34.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once we delivered the\NPhilosopher's Stone, we would be made human!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.37,0:18:35.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.66,0:18:42.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You-know-who only wants the Philosopher's Stone to go on living.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.50,0:18:45.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why there have\Nbeen so many wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.96,0:18:50.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That person is not going to make us human.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.67,0:18:52.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.30,0:18:53.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.01,0:18:56.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,will become human\Nunder my own power!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.77,0:19:02.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just as I was told.\N"You can't trust Lust."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.94,0:19:04.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a nuisance, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.70,0:19:19.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.04,0:19:31.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have to hurry.\NSloth is going after your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.80,0:19:33.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know where Tucker is?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.97,0:19:37.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The factory where he worked\Nbefore he became\Na State Alchemist is close.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.14,0:19:43.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.43,0:19:44.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not as though\NI promised you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:47.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.65,0:19:51.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I{\i0} should be the one asking why!\NWhy do you want to become human?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.32,0:19:55.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys are immortal and can\Nremain in your present forms forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.32,0:19:58.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure why, but you\Nlook like you enjoy your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.20,0:20:01.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So why would you want to become human again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.87,0:20:05.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's such a cruel thing\Nfor you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.58,0:20:10.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, why do you have to return your brother back to the way he was?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.38,0:20:15.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.30,0:20:18.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.68,0:20:21.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This "you-know-who" person who's in charge of you—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.10,0:20:25.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,by any chance,\Nis it someone I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.89,0:20:27.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.31,0:20:31.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once I become human,\NI wouldn't mind telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.82,0:20:34.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.49,0:20:38.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm still carrying your weakness!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.99,0:20:43.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't forget.\NThere's no way I could forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.87,0:20:50.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nina, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.47,0:20:55.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.20,0:20:55.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's great, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.18,0:21:02.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alphonse-kun. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.18,0:21:04.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Nina.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.27,0:21:10.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See? She knows what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.73,0:21:11.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, Nina?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.02,0:21:14.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Call me Papa, Nina.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.03,0:21:17.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Her soul...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.66,0:21:29.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Shou Tucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.04,0:21:31.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was a magnificent human transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.92,0:21:33.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.75,0:21:37.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in\Nyour soulless doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.55,0:21:41.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only a powerful will is able to \Nkeep a soul set in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.26,0:21:44.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like that wasn't\Npossible for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.97,0:21:48.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come along, Alphonse Elric.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.60,0:21:53.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't very well let such a precious Philosopher's Stone be diminished any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.69,0:21:54.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Diminished?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.45,0:22:05.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, Brother, is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.87,0:22:07.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\t(1630,3550,\c&H000000&,\3c&H000000&,\4c&H000000&)}the Philosopher's Stone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.71,0:23:40.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.38,0:23:43.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 47: "Sealing the Homunculus"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.05,0:23:45.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, Sloth.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.30,0:23:48.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your weakness is right here.
